        <mxCell id="XdiOIGGw2RGI3PieZKDf-45" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Profesor can tailor the system&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Instructors can adapt the pedagogical content of the simulation through four clearly separated configuration points: business cases, RAG knowledge files, assessment rubrics, and learning objectives. These inputs are read by the CaseDesigner, Orchestrator, ToolAgent, and Judge agents respectively. The core LangGraph structure, memory system, and reasoning processes remain fixed to guarantee consistency and reproducibility across sessions.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
