        <mxCell id="NEgNs-jiQWyuXZ_AgmjS-46" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacingLeft=19;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;li data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Coordination, cooperation, reasoning, and controlled &lt;em data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;deception&lt;/em&gt; in economic games (MAgIC/GAMA-Bench) — useful for internal “sanity checks” of the agents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1016&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;A/B testing with and without &lt;em data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1063&quot;&gt;reflection/RAG&lt;/em&gt; to observe error reduction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
